 Humans tend toward no particular alignment. The best and the worst are found among them.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Size.}{\loch
 Humans vary widely in height and build, from barely 5 feet to well over 6 feet tall. Regardless of your position in that range, your size is Medium.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Speed.}{\loch
 Your base walking speed is 30 feet.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Languages.}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart section-human}{\*\bkmkstart human}{\*\bkmkstart human-traits}{\*\bkmkend section-human}{\*\bkmkend human}{\*\bkmkend human-traits}
 You can speak, read, and write Common and one extra language of your choice. Humans typically learn the languages of other peoples they deal with, including obscure dialects. They are fond of sprinkling their speech with words borrowed from other tongues: Orc curses, Elvish musical expressions, Dwarvish military phrases, and so on.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs28\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs36\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
