Channel Divinity}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you take this oath at 3rd level, you gain the following two Channel Divinity options.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Sacred Weapon.}{\loch
 As an action, you can imbue one weapon that you are holding with positive energy, using your Channel Divinity. For 1 minute, you add your Charisma modifier to attack rolls made with that weapon (with a minimum bonus of +1). The weapon also emits bright light in a 20\u8212\'97foot radius and dim light 20 feet beyond that. If the weapon is not already magical, it becomes magical for the duration.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can end this effect on your turn as part of any other action. If you are no longer holding or carrying this weapon, or if you fall }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#unconscious" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
unconscious}{}}}\loch
, this effect ends.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Turn the Unholy.}{\loch
 As an action, you present your holy symbol and speak a prayer censuring fiends and undead, using your Channel Divinity. Each fiend or undead that can see or hear you within 30 feet of you must make a Wisdom saving throw. If the creature fails its saving throw, it is turned for 1 minute or until it takes damage.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
A turned creature must spend its turns trying to move as far away from you as it can, and it can\u8217\'92t willingly move to a space within 30 feet of you. It also can\u8217\'92t take reactions. For its action, it can use only the Dash action or try to escape from an effect that prevents it from moving. If there\u8217\'92s nowhere to move, the creature can use the Dodge action.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Aura of Devotion}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Starting at 7th level, you and friendly creatures within 10 feet of you can\u8217\'92t be }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#charmed" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
charmed}{}}}\loch
 while you are conscious.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart aura-of-devotion}{\*\bkmkend aura-of-devotion}
At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
