\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Beginning at 15th level, you are always under the effects of a }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#protection-from-evil-and-good" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
protection from evil and good}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart purity-of-spirit}{\*\bkmkend purity-of-spirit}
 spell.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Holy Nimbus}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 20th level, as an action, you can emanate an aura of sunlight. For 1 minute, bright light shines from you in a 30\u8212\'97foot radius, and dim light shines 30 feet beyond that.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Whenever an enemy creature starts its turn in the bright light, the creature takes 10 radiant damage.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
In addition, for the duration, you have advantage on saving throws against spells cast by fiends or undead.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart section-sacred-oaths}{\*\bkmkstart sacred-oaths}{\*\bkmkstart oath-of-devotion}{\*\bkmkstart holy-nimbus}{\*\bkmkend section-sacred-oaths}{\*\bkmkend sacred-oaths}{\*\bkmkend oath-of-devotion}{\*\bkmkend holy-nimbus}
Once you use this feature, you can\u8217\'92t use it again until you finish a long rest.}
