\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 11th level, you gain one of the following features of your choice.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Volley.}{\loch
 You can use your action to make a ranged attack against any number of creatures within 10 feet of a point you can see within your weapon\u8217\'92s range. You must have ammunition for each target, as normal, and you make a separate attack roll for each target.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Whirlwind Attack.}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart multiattack}{\*\bkmkend multiattack}
 You can use your action to make a melee attack against any number of creatures within 5 feet of you, with a separate attack roll for each target.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Superior Hunter\u8217\'92s Defense}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 15th level, you gain one of the following features of your choice.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Evasion.}{\loch
 When you are subjected to an effect, such as a red dragon\u8217\'92s fiery breath or a lightning bolt spell, that allows you to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, you instead take no damage if you succeed on the saving throw, and only half damage if you fail.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Stand Against the Tide.}{\loch
 When a hostile creature misses you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to force that creature to repeat the same attack against another creature (other than itself) of your choice.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Uncanny Dodge.}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart section-ranger-archetypes}{\*\bkmkstart ranger-archetypes}{\*\bkmkstart hunter}{\*\bkmkstart superior-hunters-defense}{\*\bkmkend section-ranger-archetypes}{\*\bkmkend ranger-archetypes}{\*\bkmkend hunter}{\*\bkmkend superior-hunters-defense}
 When an attacker that you can see hits you with an attack, you can use your reaction to halve the attack\u8217\'92s damage against you.}
