5th}\cell\row\pard\pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The Warlock Spell Slots by Level table shows how many spell slots you have. The table also shows what the level of those slots is; all of your spell slots are the same level. To cast one of your warlock spells of 1st level or higher, you must expend a spell slot. You regain all expended spell slots when you finish a short or long rest.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
For example, when you are 5th level, you have two 3rd-level spell slots. To cast the 1st-level spell }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#thunderwave" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
thunderwave}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart spell-slots-3}{\*\bkmkend spell-slots-3}
, you must spend one of those slots, and you cast it as a 3rd-level spell.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Spells Known of 1st Level and Higher}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 1st level, you know two 1st-level spells of your choice from the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-warlock-spells" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
warlock spell list}{}}}\loch
.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The Spells Known column of the Warlock table shows when you learn more warlock spells of your choice of 1st level and higher. A spell you choose must be of a level no higher than what\u8217\'92s shown in the Warlock Spell Slots by Level table\u8217\'92s Slot Level column for your level. When you reach 6th level, for example, you learn a new warlock spell, which can be 1st, 2nd, or 3rd level.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart spells-known-of-1st-level-and-higher-3}{\*\bkmkend spells-known-of-1st-level-and-higher-3}
Additionally, when you gain a level in this class, you can choose one of the warlock spells you know and replace it with another spell from the warlock spell list, which also must be of a level for which you have spell slots.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Spellcasting Ability}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Charisma is your spellcasting ability for your warlock spells, so you use your Charisma whenever a spell refers to your spellcasting ability. In addition, you use your Charisma modifier when setting the saving throw DC for a warlock spell you cast and when making an attack roll with one.}
\par \trowd\trql\trleft-108\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clpadft3\clpadt108\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx9252\pard\plain \s68\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb36\sa36\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\intbl\qc\nowidctlpar\sb36\sa36{\rtlch\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Spell save DC}{\rtlch \ltrch\i\loch
 = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Charisma modifier}\cell\row\pard\trowd\trql\trleft-108\ltrrow\trpaddft3\trpaddt0\trpaddfl3\trpaddl0\trpaddfb3\trpaddb0\trpaddfr3\trpaddr0\clpadft3\clpadt108\clpadfr3\clpadr108\cellx9252\pard\plain \s68\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb36\sa36\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0\intbl\qc\nowidctlpar\sb36\sa36{\rtlch\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Spell attack modifier}{\rtlch \ltrch\i\loch{\*\bkmkstart spellcasting-ability-6}{\*\bkmkend spellcasting-ability-6}
 = your proficiency bonus + your Charisma modifier}\cell\row\pard\pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Spellcasting Focus}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pact-magic}{\*\bkmkend pact-magic}
You can use an arcane focus as a spellcasting focus for your warlock spells.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Eldritch Invocations}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
In your study of occult lore, you have unearthed }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-eldritch-invocations" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
eldritch invocations}{}}}\loch
, fragments of forbidden knowledge that imbue you with an abiding magical ability.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 2nd level, you gain two eldritch invocations of your choice. When you gain certain warlock levels, you gain additional invocations of your choice, as shown in the Invocations Known column of the Warlock table.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart eldritch-invocations}{\*\bkmkend eldritch-invocations}
Additionally, when you gain a level in this class, you can choose one of the invocations you know and replace it with another invocation that you could learn at that level.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Pact Boon}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 3rd level, your otherworldly patron bestows a gift upon you for your loyal service. You gain one of the following features of your choice.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Pact of the Chain}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You learn the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#find-familiar" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
find familiar}{}}}\loch
 spell and can cast it as a ritual. The spell doesn\u8217\'92t count against your number of spells known.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you cast the spell, you can choose one of the normal forms for your familiar or one of the following special forms: imp, pseudodragon, quasit, or sprite.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pact-of-the-chain}{\*\bkmkend pact-of-the-chain}
Additionally, when you take the Attack action, you can forgo one of your own attacks to allow your familiar to make one attack of its own with its reaction.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Pact of the Blade}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can use your action to create a pact weapon in your empty hand. You can choose the form that this melee weapon takes each time you create it. You are proficient with it while you wield it. This weapon counts as magical for the purpose of overcoming resistance and immunity to nonmagical attacks and damage.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Your pact weapon disappears if it is more than 5 feet away from you for 1 minute or more. It also disappears if you use this feature again, if you dismiss the weapon (no action required), or if you die.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pact-of-the-blade}{\*\bkmkend pact-of-the-blade}
You can transform one magic weapon into your pact weapon by performing a special ritual while you hold the weapon. You perform the ritual over the course of 1 hour, which can be done during a short rest. You can then dismiss the weapon, shunting it into an extradimensional space, and it appears whenever you create your pact weapon thereafter. You can\u8217\'92t affect an artifact or a sentient weapon in this way. The weapon ceases being your pact weapon if you die, if you perform the 1-hour ritual on a different weapon, or if you use a 1-hour ritual to break your bond to it. The weapon appears at your feet if it is in the extradimensional space when the bond breaks.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Pact of the Tome}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Your patron gives you a grimoire called a Book of Shadows. When you gain this feature, choose three cantrips from any class\u8217\'92s spell list (the three needn\u8217\'92t be from the same list). While the book is on your person, you can cast those cantrips at will. They don\u8217\'92t count against your number of cantrips known. If they don\u8217\'92t appear on the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-warlock-spells" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
warlock spell list}{}}}\loch
, they are nonetheless warlock spells for you.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pact-boon}{\*\bkmkstart pact-of-the-tome}{\*\bkmkend pact-boon}{\*\bkmkend pact-of-the-tome}
If you lose your Book of Shadows, you can perform a 1-hour ceremony to receive a replacement from your patron. This ceremony can be performed during a short or long rest, and it destroys the previous book. The book turns to ash when you die.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Ability Score Improvement}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart ability-score-improvement-10}{\*\bkmkend ability-score-improvement-10}
When you reach 4th level, and again at 8th, 12th, 16th, and 19th level, you can increase one ability score of your choice by 2, or you can increase two ability scores of your choice by 1. As normal, you can\u8217\'92t increase an ability score above 20 using this feature.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Mystic Arcanum}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
At 11th level, your patron bestows upon you a magical secret called an arcanum. Choose one 6th-level spell from the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-warlock-spells" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
warlock spell list}{}}}\loch
 as this arcanum.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast your arcanum spell once without expending a spell slot. You must finish a long rest before you can do so again.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart mystic-arcanum}{\*\bkmkend mystic-arcanum}
At higher levels, you gain more warlock spells of your choice that can be cast in this way: one 7th-level spell at 13th level, one 8th-level spell at 15th level, and one 9th-level spell at 17th level. You regain all uses of your Mystic Arcanum when you finish a long rest.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Eldritch Master}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart section-warlock}{\*\bkmkstart warlock}{\*\bkmkstart eldritch-master}{\*\bkmkend section-warlock}{\*\bkmkend warlock}{\*\bkmkend eldritch-master}
At 20th level, you can draw on your inner reserve of mystical power while entreating your patron to regain expended spell slots. You can spend 1 minute entreating your patron for aid to regain all your expended spell slots from your Pact Magic feature. Once you regain spell slots with this feature, you must finish a long rest before you can do so again.}
\par \pard\plain \s2\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs28\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs36\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Eldritch Invocations}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If an eldritch invocation has prerequisites, you must meet them to learn it. You can learn the invocation at the same time that you meet its prerequisites. A level prerequisite refers to your level in this class.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Agonizing Blast}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#eldritch-blast" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
eldritch blast}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
 cantrip}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you cast }{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
eldritch blast}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart agonizing-blast}{\*\bkmkend agonizing-blast}
, add your Charisma modifier to the damage it deals on a hit.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Armor of Shadows}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#mage-armor" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
mage armor}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart armor-of-shadows}{\*\bkmkend armor-of-shadows}
 on yourself at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Ascendant Step}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: 9th level}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#levitate" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
levitate}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart ascendant-step}{\*\bkmkend ascendant-step}
 on yourself at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Beast Speech}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#speak-with-animals" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
speak with animals}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart beast-speech}{\*\bkmkend beast-speech}
 at will, without expending a spell slot.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Beguiling Influence}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart beguiling-influence}{\*\bkmkend beguiling-influence}
You gain proficiency in the Deception and Persuasion skills.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Bewitching Whispers}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: 7th level}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#compulsion" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
compulsion}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart bewitching-whispers}{\*\bkmkend bewitching-whispers}
 once using a warlock spell slot. You can\u8217\'92t do so again until you finish a long rest.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Book of Ancient Secrets}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: Pact of the Tome feature}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can now inscribe magical rituals in your Book of Shadows. Choose two 1st-level spells that have the ritual tag from any class\u8217\'92s }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#chapter-spell-lists" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
spell list}{}}}\loch
 (the two needn\u8217\'92t be from the same list). The spells appear in the book and don\u8217\'92t count against the number of spells you know. With your Book of Shadows in hand, you can cast the chosen spells as rituals. You can\u8217\'92t cast the spells except as rituals, unless you\u8217\'92ve learned them by some other means. You can also cast a warlock spell you know as a ritual if it has the ritual tag.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart book-of-ancient-secrets}{\*\bkmkend book-of-ancient-secrets}
On your adventures, you can add other ritual spells to your Book of Shadows. When you find such a spell, you can add it to the book if the spell\u8217\'92s level is equal to or less than half your warlock level (rounded up) and if you can spare the time to transcribe the spell. For each level of the spell, the transcription process takes 2 hours and costs 50 gp for the rare inks needed to inscribe it.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Chains of the Deodand}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: 15th level, Pact of the Chain feature}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#hold-monster" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
hold monster}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart chains-of-the-deodand}{\*\bkmkend chains-of-the-deodand}
 at will\u8212\'97targeting a celestial, fiend, or elemental\u8212\'97without expending a spell slot or material components. You must finish a long rest before you can use this invocation on the same creature again.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Devil\u8217\'92s Sight}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart devils-sight}{\*\bkmkend devils-sight}
You can see normally in darkness, both magical and nonmagical, to a distance of 120 feet.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Dreadful Word}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: 7th level}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#confusion" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
confusion}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart dreadful-word}{\*\bkmkend dreadful-word}
 once using a warlock spell slot. You can\u8217\'92t do so again until you finish a long rest.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Eldritch Sight}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#detect-magic" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
detect magic}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart eldritch-sight}{\*\bkmkend eldritch-sight}
 at will, without expending a spell slot.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Eldritch Spear}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#eldritch-blast" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
eldritch blast}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
 cantrip}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you cast }{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
eldritch blast}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart eldritch-spear}{\*\bkmkend eldritch-spear}
, its range is 300 feet.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Eyes of the Rune Keeper}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart eyes-of-the-rune-keeper}{\*\bkmkend eyes-of-the-rune-keeper}
You can read all writing.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Fiendish Vigor}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#false-life" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
false life}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart fiendish-vigor}{\*\bkmkend fiendish-vigor}
 on yourself at will as a 1st-level spell, without expending a spell slot or material components.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Gaze of Two Minds}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can use your action to touch a willing humanoid and perceive through its senses until the end of your next turn. As long as the creature is on the same plane of existence as you, you can use your action on subsequent turns to maintain this connection, extending the duration until the end of your next turn. While perceiving through the other creature\u8217\'92s senses, you benefit from any special senses possessed by that creature, and you are }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#blinded" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
blinded}{}}}\loch
 and }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#deafened" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
deafened}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart gaze-of-two-minds}{\*\bkmkend gaze-of-two-minds}
 to your own surroundings.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
Lifedrinker}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Prerequisite: 12th level, Pact of the Blade feature}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart lifedrinker}{\*\bkmkend lifedrinker}
