 You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects, such as }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#detect-magic" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
detect magic}{}}}\loch
, that detect magical auras. You can make a nonmagical object appear magical, a magical object appear nonmagical, or change the object\u8217\'92s magical aura so that it appears to belong to a specific school of magic that you choose. When you use this effect on an object, you can make the false magic apparent to any creature that handles the item.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
