 You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects that detect creature types, such as a paladin\u8217\'92s Divine Sense or the trigger of a }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#symbol" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
