 10 days}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Choose a spell of 5th level or lower that you can cast, that has a casting time of 1 action, and that can target you. You cast that spell\u8212\'97called the contingent spell\u8212\'97as part of casting }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch
, expending spell slots for both, but the contingent spell doesn\u8217\'92t come into effect. Instead, it takes effect when a certain circumstance occurs. You describe that circumstance when you cast the two spells. For example, a }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch
 cast with }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#water-breathing" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
water breathing}{}}}\loch
 might stipulate that }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#water-breathing" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
water breathing}{}}}\loch
 comes into effect when you are engulfed in water or a similar liquid.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The contingent spell takes effect immediately after the circumstance is met for the first time, whether or not you want it to, and then }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch
 ends.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The contingent spell takes effect only on you, even if it can normally target others. You can use only one }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch
 spell at a time. If you cast this spell again, the effect of another }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch
 spell on you ends. Also, }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#contingency" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
contingency}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart contingency}{\*\bkmkend contingency}
 ends on you if its material component is ever not on your person.}
\par \pard\plain \s4\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs24\lang1033\i0\b\kerning0{\loch
