A creature restrained by this spell must make another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this spell three times, the spell ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and subjected to the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#petrified" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
petrified}{}}}\loch
 condition for the duration. The successes and failures don\u8217\'92t need to be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
