You transform a willing creature you touch, along with everything it\u8217\'92s wearing and carrying, into a misty cloud for the duration. The spell ends if the creature drops to 0 hit points. An incorporeal creature isn\u8217\'92t affected.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
While in this form, the target\u8217\'92s only method of movement is a flying speed of 10 feet. The target can enter and occupy the space of another creature. The target has resistance to nonmagical damage, and it has advantage on Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution saving throws. The target can pass through small holes, narrow openings, and even mere cracks, though it treats liquids as though they were solid surfaces. The target can\u8217\'92t fall and remains hovering in the air even when }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#stunned" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
stunned}{}}}\loch
 or otherwise }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#incapacitated" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
incapacitated}{}}}\loch
.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart gaseous-form}{\*\bkmkend gaseous-form}
While in the form of a misty cloud, the target can\u8217\'92t talk or manipulate objects, and any objects it was carrying or holding can\u8217\'92t be dropped, used, or otherwise interacted with. The target can\u8217\'92t attack or cast spells.}
