protection from evil and good}{}}}\loch
 or }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#magic-circle" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
magic circle}{}}}\loch
 spell can\u8217\'92t be possessed). The target must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failure, your soul moves into the target\u8217\'92s body, and the target\u8217\'92s soul becomes trapped in the container. On a success, the target resists your efforts to possess it, and you can\u8217\'92t attempt to possess it again for 24 hours.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Once you possess a creature\u8217\'92s body, you control it. Your game statistics are replaced by the statistics of the creature, though you retain your alignment and your Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. You retain the benefit of your own class features. If the target has any class levels, you can\u8217\'92t use any of its class features.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Meanwhile, the possessed creature\u8217\'92s soul can perceive from the container using its own senses, but it can\u8217\'92t move or take actions at all.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
While possessing a body, you can use your action to return from the host body to the container if it is within 100 feet of you, returning the host creature\u8217\'92s soul to its body. If the host body dies while you\u8217\'92re in it, the creature dies, and you must make a Charisma saving throw against your own spellcasting DC. On a success, you return to the container if it is within 100 feet of you. Otherwise, you die.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If the container is destroyed or the spell ends, your soul immediately returns to your body. If your body is more than 100 feet away from you or if your body is dead when you attempt to return to it, you die. If another creature\u8217\'92s soul is in the container when it is destroyed, the creature\u8217\'92s soul returns to its body if the body is alive and within 100 feet. Otherwise, that creature dies.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart magic-jar}{\*\bkmkend magic-jar}
When the spell ends, the container is destroyed.}
