\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can see through its eyes and hear through its ears as if you were located where it is. On each of your turns as a bonus action, you can switch from using its senses to using your own, or back again. While you are using its senses, you are }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#blinded" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
blinded}{}}}\loch
 and }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#deafened" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
deafened}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart mislead}{\*\bkmkend mislead}
 in regard to your own surroundings.}
