 You can try to move an object that weighs up to 1,000 pounds. If the object isn\u8217\'92t being worn or carried, you automatically move it up to 30 feet in any direction, but not beyond the range of this spell.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If the object is worn or carried by a creature, you must make an ability check with your spellcasting ability contested by that creature\u8217\'92s Strength check. If you succeed, you pull the object away from that creature and can move it up to 30 feet in any direction but not beyond the range of this spell.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart telekinesis}{\*\bkmkend telekinesis}
