 If you turn a creature into another kind of creature, the new form can be any kind you choose whose challenge rating is equal to or less than the target\u8217\'92s (or its level, if the target doesn\u8217\'92t have a challenge rating). The target\u8217\'92s game statistics, including mental ability scores, are replaced by the statistics of the new form. It retains its alignment and personality.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The target assumes the hit points of its new form, and when it reverts to its normal form, the creature returns to the number of hit points it had before it transformed. If it reverts as a result of dropping to 0 hit points, any excess damage carries over to its normal form. As long as the excess damage doesn\u8217\'92t reduce the creature\u8217\'92s normal form to 0 hit points, it isn\u8217\'92t knocked }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#unconscious" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
unconscious}{}}}\loch
.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The creature is limited in the actions it can perform by the nature of its new form, and it can\u8217\'92t speak, cast spells, or take any other action that requires hands or speech, unless its new form is capable of such actions.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The target\u8217\'92s gear melds into the new form. The creature can\u8217\'92t activate, use, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Object into Creature.}{\loch
 You can turn an object into any kind of creature, as long as the creature\u8217\'92s size is no larger than the object\u8217\'92s size and the creature\u8217\'92s challenge rating is 9 or lower. The creature is friendly to you and your companions. It acts on each of your turns. You decide what action it takes and how it moves. The GM has the creature\u8217\'92s statistics and resolves all of its actions and movement.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If the spell becomes permanent, you no longer control the creature. It might remain friendly to you, depending on how you have treated it.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
Creature into Object.}{\loch{\*\bkmkstart true-polymorph}{\*\bkmkend true-polymorph}
 If you turn a creature into an object, it transforms along with whatever it is wearing and carrying into that form. The creature\u8217\'92s statistics become those of the object, and the creature has no memory of time spent in this form, after the spell ends and it returns to its normal form.}
