\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If the webs aren\u8217\'92t anchored between two solid masses (such as walls or trees) or layered across a floor, wall, or ceiling, the conjured web collapses on itself, and the spell ends at the start of your next turn. Webs layered over a flat surface have a depth of 5 feet.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
