 The sword has 1d4 \u8211\'96 1 charges. While holding it, you can use an action to expend 1 charge and cast the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#wish" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
wish}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart luck-blade}{\*\bkmkend luck-blade}
 spell from it. This property can\u8217\'92t be used again until the next dawn. The sword loses this property if it has no charges.}
