\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Weapon (any sword), very rare (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You gain a +2 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The sword has 1d8 + 1 charges. If you score a critical hit against a creature that has fewer than 100 hit points, it must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or be slain instantly as the sword tears its life force from its body (a construct or an undead is immune). The sword loses 1 charge if the creature is slain. When the sword has no charges remaining, it loses this property.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Oathbow}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Weapon (longbow), very rare (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you nock an arrow on this bow, it whispers in Elvish, \u8220\'93Swift defeat to my enemies.\u8221\'94 When you use this weapon to make a ranged attack, you can, as a command phrase, say, \u8220\'93Swift death to you who have wronged me.\u8221\'94 The target of your attack becomes your sworn enemy until it dies or until dawn seven days later. You can have only one such sworn enemy at a time. When your sworn enemy dies, you can choose a new one after the next dawn.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you make a ranged attack roll with this weapon against your sworn enemy, you have advantage on the roll. In addition, your target gains no benefit from cover, other than total cover, and you suffer no disadvantage due to long range. If the attack hits, your sworn enemy takes an extra 3d6 piercing damage.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart oathbow}{\*\bkmkend oathbow}
While your sworn enemy lives, you have disadvantage on attack rolls with all other weapons.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Oil of Etherealness}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Beads of this cloudy gray oil form on the outside of its container and quickly evaporate. The oil can cover a Medium or smaller creature, along with the equipment it\u8217\'92s wearing and carrying (one additional vial is required for each size category above Medium). Applying the oil takes 10 minutes. The affected creature then gains the effect of the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#etherealness" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
etherealness}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart oil-of-etherealness}{\*\bkmkend oil-of-etherealness}
 spell for 1 hour.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Oil of Sharpness}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, very rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart oil-of-sharpness}{\*\bkmkend oil-of-sharpness}
This clear, gelatinous oil sparkles with tiny, ultrathin silver shards. The oil can coat one slashing or piercing weapon or up to 5 pieces of slashing or piercing ammunition. Applying the oil takes 1 minute. For 1 hour, the coated item is magical and has a +3 bonus to attack and damage rolls.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Oil of Slipperiness}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, uncommon}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
This sticky black unguent is thick and heavy in the container, but it flows quickly when poured. The oil can cover a Medium or smaller creature, along with the equipment it\u8217\'92s wearing and carrying (one additional vial is required for each size category above Medium). Applying the oil takes 10 minutes. The affected creature then gains the effect of a }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#freedom-of-movement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
freedom of movement}{}}}\loch
 spell for 8 hours.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
Alternatively, the oil can be poured on the ground as an action, where it covers a 10-foot square, duplicating the effect of the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#grease" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
grease}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart oil-of-slipperiness}{\*\bkmkend oil-of-slipperiness}
 spell in that area for 8 hours.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Pearl of Power}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, uncommon (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
 by a spellcaster)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pearl-of-power}{\*\bkmkend pearl-of-power}
While this pearl is on your person, you can use an action to speak its command word and regain one expended spell slot. If the expended slot was of 4th level or higher, the new slot is 3rd level. Once you use the pearl, it can t be used again until the next dawn.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Periapt of Health}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, uncommon}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart periapt-of-health}{\*\bkmkend periapt-of-health}
You are immune to contracting any disease while you wear this pendant. If you are already infected with a disease, the effects of the disease are suppressed you while you wear the pendant.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Periapt of Proof against Poison}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
This delicate silver chain has a brilliant-cut black gem pendant. While you wear it, poisons have no effect on you. You are immune to the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#poisoned" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
poisoned}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart periapt-of-proof-against-poison}{\*\bkmkend periapt-of-proof-against-poison}
 condition and have immunity to poison damage.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Periapt of Wound Closure}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, uncommon (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart periapt-of-wound-closure}{\*\bkmkend periapt-of-wound-closure}
While you wear this pendant, you stabilize whenever you are dying at the start of your turn. In addition, whenever you roll a Hit Die to regain hit points, double the number of hit points it restores.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Philter of Love}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, uncommon}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The next time you see a creature within 10 minutes after drinking this philter, you become }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#charmed" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
charmed}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart philter-of-love}{\*\bkmkend philter-of-love}
 by that creature for 1 hour. If the creature is of a species and gender you are normally attracted to, you regard it as your true love while you are charmed. This potion\u8217\'92s rose-hued, effervescent liquid contains one easy-to-miss bubble shaped like a heart.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Pipes of Haunting}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, uncommon}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You must be proficient with wind instruments to use these pipes. They have 3 charges. You can use an action to play them and expend 1 charge to create an eerie, spellbinding tune. Each creature within 30 feet of you that hears you play must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or become }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#frightened" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
frightened}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart pipes-of-haunting}{\*\bkmkend pipes-of-haunting}
 of you for 1 minute. If you wish, all creatures in the area that aren\u8217\'92t hostile toward you automatically succeed on the saving throw. A creature that fails the saving throw can repeat it at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. A creature that succeeds on its saving throw is immune to the effect of these pipes for 24 hours. The pipes regain 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Pipes of the Sewers}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, uncommon (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You must be proficient with wind instruments to use these pipes. While you are attuned to the pipes, ordinary rats and giant rats are indifferent toward you and will not attack you unless you threaten or harm them.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
The pipes have 3 charges. If you play the pipes as an action, you can use a bonus action to expend 1 to 3 charges, calling forth one swarm of rats with each expended charge, provided that enough rats are within half a mile of you to be called in this fashion (as determined by the GM). If there aren\u8217\'92t enough rats to form a swarm, the charge is wasted. Called swarms move toward the music by the shortest available route but aren\u8217\'92t under your control otherwise. The pipes regain 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart pipes-of-the-sewers}{\*\bkmkend pipes-of-the-sewers}
Whenever a swarm of rats that isn\u8217\'92t under another creature\u8217\'92s control comes within 30 feet of you while you are playing the pipes, you can make a Charisma check contested by the swarm\u8217\'92s Wisdom check. If you lose the contest, the swarm behaves as it normally would and can\u8217\'92t be swayed by the pipes\u8217\'92 music for the next 24 hours. If you win the contest, the swarm is swayed by the pipes\u8217\'92 music and becomes friendly to you and your companions for as long as you continue to play the pipes each round as an action. A friendly swarm obeys your commands. If you issue no commands to a friendly swarm, it defends itself but otherwise takes no actions. If a friendly swarm starts its turn and can\u8217\'92t hear the pipes\u8217\'92 music, your control over that swarm ends, and the swarm behaves as it normally would and can\u8217\'92t be swayed by the pipes\u8217\'92 music for the next 24 hours.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Plate Armor of Etherealness}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Armor (plate), legendary (requires }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-attunement" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
attunement}{}}}\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
)}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart plate-armor-of-etherealness}{\*\bkmkend plate-armor-of-etherealness}
While you\u8217\'92re wearing this armor, you can speak its command word as an action to gain the effect of the etherealness spell, which last for 10 minutes or until you remove the armor or use an action to speak the command word again. This property of the armor can\u8217\'92t be used again until the next dawn.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Portable Hole}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Wondrous item, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
This fine black cloth, soft as silk, is folded up to the dimensions of a handkerchief. It unfolds into a circular sheet 6 feet in diameter.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can use an action to unfold a portable hole and place it on or against a solid surface, whereupon the portable hole creates an extradimensional hole 10 feet deep. The cylindrical space within the hole exists on a different plane, so it can\u8217\'92t be used to create open passages. Any creature inside an open portable hole can exit the hole by climbing out of it.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
You can use an action to close a portable hole by taking hold of the edges of the cloth and folding it up. Folding the cloth closes the hole, and any creatures or objects within remain in the extradimensional space. No matter what\u8217\'92s in it, the hole weighs next to nothing.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
If the hole is folded up, a creature within the hole\u8217\'92s extradimensional space can use an action to make a DC 10 Strength check. On a successful check, the creature forces its way out and appears within 5 feet of the portable hole or the creature carrying it. A breathing creature within a closed portable hole can survive for up to 10 minutes, after which time it begins to suffocate.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart portable-hole}{\*\bkmkend portable-hole}
Placing a portable hole inside an extradimensional space created by a bag of holding, handy haversack, or similar item instantly destroys both items and opens a gate to the astral plane. The gate originates where the one item was placed inside the other. Any creature within 10 feet of the gate is sucked through it and deposited in a random location on the astral plane. The gate then closes. The gate is one-way only and can\u8217\'92t be reopened.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Animal Friendship}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, uncommon}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you drink this potion, you can cast the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#animal-friendship" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
animal friendship}{}}}\loch
 spell (save DC 13) for 1 hour at will.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-animal-friendship}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-animal-friendship}
Agitating this muddy liquid brings little bits into view: a fish scale, a hummingbird tongue, a cat claw, or a squirrel hair.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Clairvoyance}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you drink this potion, you gain the effect of the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#clairvoyance" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
clairvoyance}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-clairvoyance}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-clairvoyance}
 spell. An eyeball bobs in this yellowish liquid but vanishes when the potion is opened.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Climbing}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, common}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-climbing}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-climbing}
When you drink this potion, you gain a climbing speed equal to your walking speed for 1 hour. During this time, you have advantage on Strength (Athletics) checks you make to climb. The potion is separated into brown, silver, and gray layers resembling bands of stone. Shaking the bottle fails to mix the colors.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Diminution}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you drink this potion, you gain the \u8220\'93reduce\u8221\'94 effect of the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#enlargereduce" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
enlarge/reduce}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-diminution}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-diminution}
 spell for 1d4 hours (no concentration required). The red in the potion\u8217\'92s liquid continuously contracts to a tiny bead and then expands to color the clear liquid around it. Shaking the bottle fails to interrupt this process.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Flying}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, very rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-flying}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-flying}
When you drink this potion, you gain a flying speed equal to your walking speed for 1 hour and can hover. If you\u8217\'92re in the air when the potion wears off, you fall unless you have some other means of staying aloft. This potion\u8217\'92s clear liquid floats at the top of its container and has cloudy white impurities drifting in it.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
Potion of Gaseous Form}
\par \pard\plain \s67\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai \ltrch\i\loch
Potion, rare}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
When you drink this potion, you gain the effect of the }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#gaseous-form" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
gaseous form}{}}}\loch{\*\bkmkstart potion-of-gaseous-form}{\*\bkmkend potion-of-gaseous-form}
 spell for 1 hour (no concentration required) or until you end the effect as a bonus action. This potion\u8217\'92s container seems to hold fog that moves and pours like water.}
\par \pard\plain \s3\dbch\af9\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ab\ql\keep\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb200\sa0\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw5\brdrcf31\brsp20\keepn\ltrpar\cf17\loch\f4\fs32\lang1033\b\kerning0{\loch
