Ring of Air Elemental Command.}{\loch
 You can expend 2 of the ring\u8217\'92s charges to cast }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#dominate-monster" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
dominate monster}{}}}\loch
