stone shape}{}}}\loch
 (2 charges), }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#stoneskin" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
stoneskin}{}}}\loch
