This ring has 3 charges, and it regains 1d3 expended charges daily at dawn. While wearing the ring, you can use an action to expend 1 to 3 of its charges to attack one creature you can see within 60 feet of you. The ring produces a spectral ram\u8217\'92s head and makes its attack roll with a +7 bonus. On a hit, for each charge you spend, the target takes 2d10 force damage and is pushed 5 feet away from you.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart ring-of-the-ram}{\*\bkmkend ring-of-the-ram}
Alternatively, you can expend 1 to 3 of the ring\u8217\'92s charges as an action to try to break an object you can see within 60 feet of you that isn\u8217\'92t being worn or carried. The ring makes a Strength check with a +5 bonus for each charge you spend.}
