 As an action, you can plant the haft end of the rod in the ground, whereupon the rod\u8217\'92s head sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius and dim light for an additional 60 feet. While in that bright light, you and any creature that is friendly to you gain a +1 bonus to AC and saving throws and can sense the location of any }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#invisible" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
invisible}{}}}\loch
 hostile creature that is also in the bright light.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch{\*\bkmkstart rod-of-alertness}{\*\bkmkend rod-of-alertness}
The rod\u8217\'92s head stops glowing and the effect ends after 10 minutes, or when a creature uses an action to pull the rod from the ground. This property can\u8217\'92t be used again until the next dawn.}
