 You can use an action to cause a bolt of lightning to leap from the staff\u8217\'92s tip in a line that is 5 feet wide and 120 feet long. Each creature in that line must make a DC 17 Dexterity saving throw, taking 9d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.}
