A monster can be Tiny, Small, Medium, Large, Huge, or Gargantuan. The Size Categories table shows how much space a creature of a particular size controls in combat. see \u8220\'93}{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#section-movement-and-position" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
Movement and Position}{}}}\loch
\u8221\'94 for more information on creature size and space.}
