 12 (2d6 + 5) bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or become diseased. The disease has no effect for 1 minute and can be removed by any magic that cures disease. After 1 minute, the diseased creature\u8217\'92s skin becomes translucent and slimy, the creature can\u8217\'92t regain hit points unless it is underwater, and the disease can be removed only by }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#heal" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch\ai \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\i\loch
heal}{}}}\loch
 or another disease-curing spell of 6th level or higher. When the creature is outside a body of water, it takes 6 (1d12) acid damage every 10 minutes unless moisture is applied to the skin before 10 minutes have passed.}
