\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\loch
While it has 0 hit points in mist form, it can\u8217\'92t revert to its vampire form, and it must reach its resting place within 2 hours or be destroyed. Once in its resting place, it reverts to its vampire form. It is then }{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "#paralyzed" }{\fldrslt {\rtlch \ltrch\hich\af4\cf17\loch\f4\fs22\loch
paralyzed}{}}}\loch
 until it regains at least 1 hit point. After spending 1 hour in its resting place with 0 hit points, it regains 1 hit point.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
