 The vampire regains 20 hit points at the start of its turn if it has at least 1 hit point and isn\u8217\'92t in sunlight or running water. If the vampire takes radiant damage or damage from holy water, this trait doesn\u8217\'92t function at the start of the vampire\u8217\'92s next turn.}
\par \pard\plain \s63\dbch\af10\langfe1033\dbch\af9\afs24\alang1025\ql\widctlpar\hyphpar0\sb180\sa180\ltrpar\cf0\loch\f4\fs22\lang1033\kerning0{\rtlch\ai\ab \ltrch\i\b\loch
